{
  "family": "sanotts",
  "i18n": {
    "description": {
      "en": "Very small multilingual text-to-speech across fourteen languages. Two graphs: the nano lineage (duration student, contextual acoustic student to mel-100, noise-fed ConvNeXt-1D decoder with an iSTFT head; voices heart 2.27M and heart-nano 294k, English, 24 kHz) and the deterministic piperlite lineage (duration student, acoustic student to a 192-channel latent, optionally through a calibration adapter, then a 3-stage ConvTranspose1d decoder with dilated residual banks; voices amy, hfc and kristin for English, vi, id, cs, de, es, fr, it, pt, ro, ru, tr, ne and hi at 1.1-1.8M parameters, 22.05 kHz). Uses an external eSpeak-ng phonemizer.",
      "zh": "超小型多语言文本转语音，覆盖十四种语言。两条图：nano 谱系（时长 student、上下文声学 student 至 mel-100、带 iSTFT 头的噪声驱动 ConvNeXt-1D 解码器；音色 heart 2.27M 与 heart-nano 294k，英语，24 kHz）；确定性 piperlite 谱系（时长 student、声学 student 至 192 通道潜在，可选经校准适配器，再由带空洞残差块的三级 ConvTranspose1d 解码器解码；音色 amy、hfc、kristin 以及 vi、id、cs、de、es、fr、it、pt、ro、ru、tr、ne、hi，参数 1.1-1.8M，22.05 kHz）。使用外部 eSpeak-ng 音素器。"
    },
    "options": {
      "seed": {
        "en": "Decoder noise seed. The decoder is noise-fed, so a given seed picks one of many valid renderings; 0 derives it from the text as sha256(text)[:8], which is what the reference implementations do. Piperlite voices are deterministic and ignore the seed.",
        "zh": "解码器噪声种子。解码器以噪声驱动，因此同一 seed 只是从多种合法结果中选一种；0 表示由文本按 sha256(text)[:8] 推导，与参考实现一致。Piperlite 音色是确定性的，会忽略该 seed。"
      },
      "speed": {
        "en": "Speech speed multiplier; larger is faster. Its reciprocal scales the voice's tuned length scale before the per-token clamp.",
        "zh": "语速倍率；越大越快。其倒数会在逐 token 限制前缩放音色的调校长度比例。"
      },
      "text_chunk_mode": {
        "en": "Long-form text chunking mode.",
        "zh": "长文本分块模式。"
      },
      "text_chunk_size": {
        "en": "Maximum Unicode codepoints per long-form text chunk; default 280.",
        "zh": "每个长文本分块的最大 Unicode 码点数；默认 280。"
      }
    }
  },
